7 saves and the Anaheim Ducks opened the season by holding off the Vegas Golden Knights 4-3 on Friday night.","story":"LAS VEGAS -- — <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5149153/leo-carlsson\">Leo Carlsson</a> had a goal and an assist, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4588165/lukas-dostal\">Lukas Dostal</a> made 27 saves and the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/ana/anaheim-ducks\">Anaheim Ducks</a> opened the season by holding off the <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/team/_/name/vgk/vegas-golden-knights\">Vegas Golden Knights</a> 4-3 on Friday night.\n\n\r\n              The teams met last season in the second round of the playoffs, with Vegas winning in six games and going on to win the Western Conference. The Golden Knights opened Tuesday night at home with a 5-2 victory over Chicago.\n\n\r\n              Carlson set up <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5216858/beckett-sennecke\">Beckett Sennecke</a>'s goal with eight seconds left in the first period, then scored at 7:03 of the second to cap a three-goal burst for a 4-0 lead. <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4968/alex-killorn\">Alex Killorn</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4895214/jeff-malott\">Jeff Malott</a> also scored.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/3042055/shea-theodore\">Shea Theodore</a>, <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/2976844/tomas-hertl\">Tomas Hertl</a> and <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/5272307/braeden-bowman\">Braeden Bowman</a> scored for Vegas in the third period, with Bowman connecting with 2:50 left. Hertl struck on a power play.\n\n\r\n              <a href=\"http://www.espn.com/nhl/player/_/id/4064582/carter-hart\">Carter Hart</a> stopped 16 shots for the Golden Knights.\n\n\r\n              <hl2>Up next</hl2>\r\n              Ducks: Host Florida on Sunday.\n\n\r\n              Golden Knights: At Vancouver on Sunday night.\n\n\r\n              ------\n\n\r\n              \r\n                <a href=\"https://apnews.com/hub/nhl\">See AP’s full NHL coverage here</a>","published":"2026-10-03T04:45:30Z"}}